LOCUS       pAS155                  5912 bp    DNA     circular SYN 15-APR-2023
DEFINITION  This is the base Bxb1 integration vector for reporter studies. The 
            promoter, CDS and 3'UTR has nice flanking restriction sites.
            
            sgRNAs against GFP and mCherry used for screening are also noted 
            here.
